SCOPE NOTE — this MIT licence covers the SOURCE CODE only.

It does NOT cover the article body text shipped in the evaluation datasets
(`data/english/test/cases.jsonl`, `data/english/folds/fold_*/**/cases.jsonl`,
`data/chinese_eval/cases.jsonl`). That text is a frozen snapshot of third-party
news articles; copyright remains with the original publishers, and it is
provided solely for research reproducibility (embedding / recall / pairwise
model inputs). Do not redistribute it commercially or re-publish it as a news
corpus. Per-record publisher URLs are preserved in each case's `case_link`
field. See `data/README.md` and `docs/DATA_LAYOUT.md` §7.
